  "name": "Retrieval, Grounding and Attribution",
  "courseCode": "E3",
  "description": "Retrieval past the naive stage: chunking as a decision with consequences, hybrid dense and sparse search, reranking, and attribution you can verify. Naive top-k RAG is where this subject starts, not where it ends.",
