  "teaches": [
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain how chunk size and overlap trade recall against precision.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to implement a chunker that preserves semantic boundaries.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain why dense and sparse retrieval fail on different queries.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to implement reciprocal rank fusion to combine two rankings."
